erId":"90049","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79488"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1519"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24385"},"originalCharacterName":"村沢 伊月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her parents died in a car accident, and she was raised by her grandparents. Not wanting her to cause any trouble, her grandparents enrolles her in an all-girls boarding school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her mind has trouble processing the trauma of losing her parents-- Itsuki, formerly an ordinary girl, has shut off her heart completely and tries her best to avoid any sort of relationship with others. In her new school, she always spends her time alone and doesn't make any friends, and her classmates don't seem to want to have much to do with her either."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is reading, and her grades are a little bit above average."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24385"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交通事故で両親を亡くし、祖父母に引き取られるが、迷惑が掛かるのを嫌い全寮制の女子校に転入し一人で生きていく事を決める。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1519","sourceWorkId":"18798","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"体内に寄生した触手生物に、悩まされるもその生物と精神の一部を共有しながら様々な事件を乗り越え、共存するようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師に成り済まし生物駆除の為に現れた退魔師【神荘瑠依】から、他にも類似した事例がある事を聞き、触手生物から得られる能力を駆使し捜査に協力する事を決める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"触手を宿している事で人並み外れた免疫力や回復力を持ち、年齢が静止している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1519","sourceWorkId":"21779","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交通事故で両親を亡くし祖父母に引き取られるが、迷惑が掛かるのを嫌い全寮制の女子校に転入し、一人で生きていくことを決める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を失った精神的痛手は未だ癒えず、元々ごく普通の女の子だった伊月はすっかり心を閉ざしてしまい、人との関わりを避けるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転校以来、友達も作らず常に一人で過ごす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトもあまり彼女に関わろうとしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書。 成績はほどほどに良くできるくらい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1519","sourceWorkId":"39660","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"交通事故で両親を亡くし祖父母に引き取られるが、迷惑が掛かるのを嫌い全寮制の女子校に転入し、一人で生きていくことを決める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を失った精神的痛手は未だ癒えず、元々ごく普通の女の子だった伊月はすっかり心を閉ざしてしまい、人との関わりを避けるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"転校以来、友達も作らず常に一人で過ごす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトもあまり彼女に関わろうとしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は読書。 成績はほどほどに良くできるくらい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90049"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bcb5987b8f1ff586bef3b63c007704440f67630b2ee2b16e53f895872af16cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60ab426cd74f91c53c3128ff47a9174948afd20dc4633b44605c3ec3e8aba59d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長瀬ゆずは","creatorId":"vndb:s2287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2287","name":"長瀬ゆずは","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:132898:90049:24238:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24388","characterName":"神荘 瑠依","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90052","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"132898"},{"characterId":"90052","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79488"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1522"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24388"},"originalCharacterName":"神荘 瑠依","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though her public appearance is that of a part-timer working as a teacher, her true profession is solving paranormal phenomena using ancient techniques-- that is, an exorcist. She was hired to examine the school after a certain person told her about a nest of parasitic creatures that have infested it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a silent and cool personality, and only ever talks when it's necessary."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24388"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常勤教師はいくつもある表の顔の一つで、本業は人知れず古の技を用いて超自然現象を解決するという事を仕事としている所謂「退魔師」。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1522","sourceWorkId":"18798","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"寄生生物を探し出し狩る退魔師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"失踪事件の発生する名門校に伊月ともに潜入し、事件を捜査している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"必要なこと以外には殆ど口を聞くことも無く言葉数が少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"几帳面でクールな印象だが、粗雑な一面を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古風で堅物な為、男性経験が少ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1522","sourceWorkId":"21779","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常勤教師はいくつもある表の顔の一つで、本業は人知れず古の技を用いて超自然現象を解決することを仕事としている、いわゆる 「退魔師」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある人物の依頼を受けて学園に巣食う寄生生物を処理しにやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙でクール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"必要なこと以外にはほとんど口をきくこともない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1522","sourceWorkId":"39660","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常勤教師はいくつもある表の顔の一つで、本業は人知れず古の技を用いて超自然現象を解決することを仕事としている、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる “退魔師”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある人物の依頼を受けて学園に巣食う寄生生物を処理しにやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙でクール。 必要なこと以外にはほとんど口をきくこともない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90052"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3208028af618cb01a3ada42b47a840dc59f8dc55e2644621e060966aa9ca780.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a487a2d1a1db461b0e1676bc2d5d49aea332568fdd8045131e6ae284d9e32fa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"Raica","creatorId":"vndb:s5100","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5100","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5100","name":"Raica","roleCode":"voic